{"decision_support_systems": "Decision Support Systems is a peer-reviewed academic journal that focuses on the research and development of computer-based systems designed to aid decision-making processes across various fields. It serves as a platform for scholars, researchers, and practitioners to share innovative ideas, methodologies, and applications related to decision support technologies.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems is a peer-reviewed academic journal that focuses on the development and application of decision support systems. It serves as a platform for researchers and practitioners to share their findings and innovations in the field of decision-making technologies.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems is a scholarly journal that focuses on the research and development of systems designed to aid decision-making processes in various fields.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems refers to a journal or publication that focuses on the research and development of systems designed to aid decision-making processes. It is a platform where scholars and practitioners share insights and innovations in the field of decision support technologies.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems is a peer-reviewed academic journal that focuses on the research and development of decision support systems, which are computer-based information systems that support business or organizational decision-making activities."},
