{"decision_support_systems__year__2020": "The predicate 'year' indicates the specific year in which the subject, Decision Support Systems, was referenced or published. It serves as a temporal marker, situating the subject within a particular timeframe.|Here is another description: The predicate 'year' indicates the specific year in which the publication or event associated with the subject took place. In this context, it refers to the year of publication for the article in the Decision Support Systems journal.|Here is another description: The predicate 'year' indicates the specific year in which the publication or event associated with the subject took place, providing a temporal context for the subject's activities or outputs.|Here is another description: The predicate 'year' indicates the specific year in which a particular issue, article, or volume of the Decision Support Systems journal was published. It serves as a temporal marker to identify the timeframe of the publication.|Here is another description: The predicate \"year\" indicates the specific year in which a particular issue, article, or volume of the Decision Support Systems journal was published. It serves as a temporal marker, helping to contextualize the research within a given timeframe."},
