{"the_application_of_state_of_the_art_deep_learning_dl_models_for_textual_feature_extraction": "The utilization of cutting-edge deep learning algorithms to analyze and extract meaningful features from textual data within financial reports, aiming to enhance the detection of financial statement fraud through a more comprehensive analysis that includes both financial and textual information."},
