{"the_proposed_method": "The proposed method refers to a state-of-the-art deep learning model designed for the intelligent prediction of financial statement fraud. This method integrates both financial and textual data from annual reports to enhance the detection process.|Here is another description: The proposed method refers to a state-of-the-art deep learning model designed for screening financial reports. It aims to detect financial statement fraud by combining financial and textual data, offering superior predictive performance."},
