{"an_encoder_and_an_attention_mechanism": "The encoder and attention mechanism are integral parts of the HAN model. The encoder generates relevant contexts by constructing sentence vectors based on words, while the attention mechanism calculates importance weights, allowing the model to aggregate these sentence vectors into a coherent document representation."},
