{"us_companies_annual_financial_reports_10_k_filings": "US companies' annual financial reports, also known as 10-K filings, are comprehensive documents that publicly traded companies in the United States are required to submit to the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) on an annual basis. These reports include a wide range of financial data and are a critical source of information for investors, analysts, and regulators."},
