{"the_most_popular_approach": "The most popular approach signifies that modeling using financial data (FIN) is the leading and commonly preferred method among various techniques for fraud detection, as evidenced by its frequent use and comparison with other methods like linguistic features (LING) and their combination (FIN + LING)."},
