{"case_of_high_dimensional_financial_fraud_data": "The \"case of high-dimensional financial fraud data\" refers to datasets that contain a large number of variables or features related to financial transactions, where the goal is to detect fraudulent activities. These datasets are complex due to their high dimensionality and the subtle patterns that may indicate fraud."},
