{"the_richer_input_of_the_actual_md_a_content": "The richer input of the actual MD&A content refers to the more comprehensive and detailed textual data used in the TXT modeling, which includes pre-trained embeddings and additional financial data, as opposed to the simpler linguistic features used in the LING models."},
