{"sensitivity_exceeding_those_of_all_other_benchmarks_except_svm": "The object \"sensitivity exceeding those of all other benchmarks except SVM\" describes HAN's performance metric, indicating that its sensitivity is higher than that of most other models, with only SVM having a comparable or slightly better sensitivity. This makes HAN a promising model for fraud detection."},
