{"much_improvement_with_added_fin_data": "\"Much improvement with added FIN data\" refers to the expected or desired increase in performance metrics, such as accuracy or F1-score, when financial data is incorporated into the model's input alongside textual data. The lack of significant improvement suggests that the addition of financial data did not substantially enhance GPT-2's performance."},
