{"a_promising_alternative_to_the_dl_methods": "A promising alternative to the DL methods refers to HAN's capability to offer improved performance, interpretability, and new opportunities in fraud detection, making it a valuable addition to the existing research and practical applications in the field."},
{"modeling_on_han": "Modeling on HAN refers to the process of using a Hierarchical Attention Network (HAN) to analyze and interpret data. This approach is particularly relevant in the context of fraud detection, where it aims to enhance the understanding and classification of fraudulent activities."},
