{"its_capacity_to_incorporate_and_extract_additional_values_from_the_diversified_input": "The object \"its capacity to incorporate and extract additional values from the diversified input\" describes the specific capability of the HAN model. This refers to the model's ability to process and utilize a wide range of input data, extracting meaningful insights and values that contribute to improved fraud detection methods."},
{"results_of_han": "The results of HAN refer to the outcomes and findings derived from the application of the Hierarchical Attention Network (HAN) in the context of fraud detection. These results demonstrate the model's effectiveness in processing diverse inputs and enhancing the detection process.|Here is another description: The results of HAN refer to the outcomes obtained from the application of a hierarchical attention network (HAN) in the context of fraud detection. These results demonstrate the effectiveness of HAN in processing and leveraging diverse input data.|Here is another description: The results of HAN refer to the outcomes obtained from the Hierarchical Attention Network (HAN) model used in the study for fraud detection. These results demonstrate the model's effectiveness in processing and leveraging diverse input data."},
