{"particularly_important_for_practitioners": "Being particularly important for practitioners means that the interpretability capacity of the model holds significant value for professionals who use the model in their work. For practitioners, especially those involved in fields like audit or fraud detection, the ability to substantiate judgments and decisions with clear, understandable explanations is crucial."},
