{"full_disclosure_on_critical_accounting_estimates_and_policies": "Full disclosure on critical accounting estimates and policies refers to the comprehensive and transparent reporting of the assumptions and methods used by companies in their financial statements. This includes the significant judgments and estimates that can affect the reported financial position and performance of a company."},
{"md_a_sections": "The MD&A (Management's Discussion and Analysis) sections are parts of financial reports where management discusses the company's financial performance, liquidity, capital resources, and other factors that may affect the company's financial condition."},
