{"no_changes_were_made_to_the_information_or_style_of_language_in_md_a_sections": "No changes were made to the information or style of language in MD&A sections indicates the result of Li's study, which found that despite the increase in length of MD&A sections after SOX, there were no significant alterations in the information content or the style of language used."},
