{"a_method_to_facilitate_the_audit_of_the_md_a_section": "The object \"a method to facilitate the audit of the MD&A section\" describes the outcome of the subject's efforts. This method is designed to improve the audit process of the Management Discussion and Analysis (MD&A) section of financial reports by employing advanced textual analysis techniques to detect potential fraud or misleading information."},
