{"zhou_et_al": "Zhou et al. refers to a group of researchers or authors who have conducted a study or experiment related to textual analysis and fraud detection.|Here is another description: Zhou et al. are researchers or authors who have contributed to the field of deception detection, particularly in the context of text analysis and fraud detection."},
