{"hajek_and_henriques__explored__the_use_of_green_flag_and_red_flag_values_of_financial_indicators": "The predicate 'explored' indicates that Hajek and Henriques conducted a study or investigation into a specific topic, in this case, the use of 'green-flag' and 'red-flag' values of financial indicators."},
{"the_use_of_green_flag_and_red_flag_values_of_financial_indicators": "The use of 'green-flag' and'red-flag' values of financial indicators refers to a method of categorizing financial data where 'green-flag' values indicate non-fraudulent, interpretable financial health, while'red-flag' values would theoretically indicate potential fraud, though these are more complex and less interpretable."},
