{"we__suggest__the_use_of_textual_elements_as_red_flags_for_auditors": "The predicate \"suggest\" indicates that the authors are putting forward a recommendation or proposal. In this context, it means they are advocating for a novel approach to enhance the auditing process by using textual elements as indicators of potential fraud."},
