{"fraudulent_actors_are_capable_of_manipulating_their_writings_to_have_convincing_similarities_to_non_fraudulent_writings": "The object \"fraudulent actors are capable of manipulating their writings to have convincing similarities to non-fraudulent writings\" describes the belief that individuals involved in fraudulent activities have the ability to craft their written communications in a way that closely mimics legitimate, non-fraudulent texts, making detection more challenging."},
