{"decision_support_systems": "Decision Support Systems is a peer-reviewed academic journal that focuses on the research and development of computer-based decision support systems. It serves as a platform for scholars and practitioners to share insights, innovations, and findings in the field of decision support technologies, covering topics such as data analytics, artificial intelligence, and human-computer interaction.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems is a peer-reviewed academic journal that focuses on the development and application of decision support systems. It serves as a platform for researchers to share their findings and innovations in the field of decision-making technologies.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems is a scholarly journal that focuses on the research and development of systems designed to aid decision-making processes in various fields.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems refers to a journal or publication that focuses on the research and development of systems designed to aid decision-making processes. It is a platform where scholars and practitioners share insights and innovations in the field of decision support technologies.|Here is another description: Decision Support Systems is a scholarly journal that publishes research articles related to the field of decision support systems, which are computer-based systems designed to aid decision-making activities."},
{"decision_support_systems__volume__139": "The term \"volume\" in this context refers to a specific issue or edition of the journal, indicating a collection of articles published together under a single volume number.|Here is another description: The predicate \"volume\" in this context refers to the specific issue or edition of the journal \"Decision Support Systems.\" Each volume typically contains a collection of articles published within a certain timeframe.|Here is another description: The predicate \"volume\" in this context refers to the specific issue or edition of the journal \"Decision Support Systems.\" It indicates the particular volume number that contains the article or research paper being referenced.|Here is another description: The predicate 'volume' refers to a specific issue or edition of the journal, indicating the sequence in which the journal is published over time.|Here is another description: The predicate 'volume' indicates the specific edition or issue number of the journal in which the article is published, signifying the sequence and chronology of the journal's publications."},
{"139": "Volume 139 of Decision Support Systems represents a particular edition of the journal published in 2020, containing a curated selection of articles related to the field of decision support systems.|Here is another description: Volume 139 of Decision Support Systems is a specific edition of the journal published in 2020. This volume includes various research articles related to the field of decision support systems.|Here is another description: Volume 139 of Decision Support Systems is a specific edition of the journal published in 2020. This volume includes various articles and research papers related to the field of decision support systems.|Here is another description: Volume 139 of Decision Support Systems represents the 139th edition of the journal, containing a collection of articles published in that particular issue.|Here is another description: Volume 139 represents the 139th edition of the Decision Support Systems journal, published in the year 2020, containing a collection of articles, including the one with the identifier 113421."},
{"decision_support_systems__year__2020": "The predicate 'year' indicates the specific year in which the subject, Decision Support Systems, was referenced or published. This helps in understanding the timeliness and relevance of the information provided by the subject.|Here is another description: The predicate \"year\" indicates the specific time frame in which the subject, Decision Support Systems, was referenced or published. It highlights the temporal context of the subject's activity or relevance.|Here is another description: The predicate \"year\" indicates the specific year in which a particular issue, volume, or article was published within the journal. It helps to contextualize the research within a temporal framework.|Here is another description: The predicate 'year' indicates the specific year in which the publication or event associated with the subject took place. In this context, it refers to the year 2020 when the article was published in the journal Decision Support Systems.|Here is another description: The predicate \"year\" indicates the specific year in which a particular issue, article, or volume of the Decision Support Systems journal was published. It serves as a temporal marker to situate the publication within a historical context."},
{"2020": "The year 2020 is significant for the publication and relevance of various documents and studies, including those on Decision Support Systems and the \"Report to the Nations 2020 Global Study on Occupational Fraud and Abuse.\" It marks the release of important research and data, providing a contemporary context for understanding advancements and current issues in these fields.|Here is another description: The year 2020 signifies the publication year of the referenced volume or issue of Eur. J. Oper. Res., which includes articles on operations research models, applications, and managerial implications.|Here is another description: The year 2020 is the specific year when the publication in Decis. Support. Syst. was released, marking it as a recent contribution to the field of decision support systems."},
{"decision_support_systems__article_number__113421": "The article number is a unique identifier assigned to each article published in a journal. It helps in distinguishing and referencing specific articles within the journal's volume and issue.|Here is another description: The predicate 'article number' refers to the unique identifier assigned to a specific article within a journal. This number is used to distinguish one article from another and facilitates easy referencing and citation.|Here is another description: The article number is a unique identifier assigned to a specific article within a journal, used for citation and reference purposes. It helps in locating and identifying the article among others published in the same journal.|Here is another description: The article number is a unique identifier assigned to each article published in a journal, used for citation and reference purposes.|Here is another description: The predicate \"article number\" refers to the unique identifier assigned to a specific article within a journal. This number is used to distinguish one article from another and facilitates citation and reference."},
{"113421": "113421 is the specific article number assigned to a particular article published in the Decision Support Systems journal, indicating its position and identity within the journal's publication sequence.|Here is another description: 113421 is the article number assigned to the specific article authored by P. Craja et al. and published in the journal Decision Support Systems in 2020. This number is crucial for uniquely identifying and citing the article in academic and professional contexts.|Here is another description: 113421 is the specific article number assigned to the article authored by P. Craja et al. and published in the journal Decision Support Systems in the year 2020. This number is used to uniquely identify the article within the journal's publication.|Here is another description: 113421 is the specific article number assigned to the research article by P. Craja et al. published in the Decision Support Systems journal in 2020.|Here is another description: 113421 is the article number assigned to the specific research article published in the journal Decision Support Systems, authored by P. Craja et al. in the year 2020."},
{"decision_support_systems__doi__10_1016_j_dss_2020_113421": "The Digital Object Identifier (DOI) is a unique alphanumeric string assigned to a digital object, such as an article published in a journal, to provide a persistent link to its location on the internet."},
