{"sciencedirect": "ScienceDirect is a leading full-text scientific database offering journal articles and book chapters from more than 2,500 peer-reviewed journals and more than 11,000 books in a wide range of subject areas. It serves as a comprehensive resource for academic and professional research.|Here is another description: ScienceDirect is a platform that provides access to a vast collection of scientific and technical research papers, articles, and journals. It serves as a comprehensive resource for researchers, academics, and professionals seeking up-to-date information in various fields of study."},
