{"red_flag_indicators": "Red-flag indicators are specific signs or signals that warn of potential issues or dangers, in this case, fraud. These indicators help auditors make informed decisions by highlighting areas that require further investigation or scrutiny.|Here is another description: Red-flag indicators are specific features or signals that suggest the potential presence of fraud within financial statements or business operations."},
