{"fraud_detection": "Fraud detection involves identifying and preventing fraudulent activities, particularly in financial contexts, through various techniques such as logistic regression, deep learning, and natural language processing. It aims to maximize the detection of fraudulent instances while minimizing misclassification of legitimate transactions, thereby reducing risk and cost. This process is critical for maintaining the integrity of financial systems and is a key area of study in finance, cybersecurity, and data analytics."},
