{"cost_of_failing_to_detect_statement_fraud": "The cost of failing to detect statement fraud refers to the financial and reputational damages incurred when fraudulent activities in financial statements go unnoticed. This cost is significant as it can lead to severe consequences for stakeholders, including investors, creditors, and the general public."},
