{"focusing_on_early_warning_signs_of_fraud": "Focusing on early warning signs of fraud refers to the proactive identification and monitoring of indicators that may suggest fraudulent activities within an organization or financial system. This approach aims to detect potential fraud before it escalates, thereby protecting assets and maintaining integrity.|Here is another description: Focusing on early warning signs of fraud involves identifying and monitoring indicators that may suggest fraudulent activities are occurring or about to occur. This proactive approach is crucial in financial and auditing contexts to prevent significant losses and maintain integrity."},
