{"linguistic_features": "Linguistic features refer to the characteristics and elements of language, such as syntax, semantics, and phonetics, that are used to convey meaning and information.|Here is another description: Linguistic features refer to the various elements of language, such as syntax, semantics, and pragmatics, that can be quantitatively analyzed. In the context of corporate disclosures, these features are extracted from textual data to gain insights into the communication strategies and underlying sentiments of the companies."},
