{"detection_of_fraud": "Detection of fraud in this context refers to the process of identifying fraudulent activities or misrepresentations within a company's financial documentation. This can involve analyzing linguistic cues, using predetermined word lists associated with specific sentiments, or employing machine learning algorithms to differentiate between fraudulent and non-fraudulent texts."},
