{"management": "Management refers to the individuals responsible for overseeing and directing the operations of an organization. In the context of annual reports and financial documentation, management plays a crucial role in providing insights into the company's performance and future potential.|Here is another description: Management refers to the individuals or group responsible for overseeing and directing the operations of an organization, such as a company or institution. In the context of annual reports and financial documentation, management plays a crucial role in providing information and insights about the organization's performance, future potential, and primary threats."},
