{"understand_its_meaning": "\"Understand its meaning\" refers to the ability of textual analysis models based on DL to go beyond simple word recognition and frequency analysis. These models can grasp the context, grammar, and structure of sentences, allowing them to extract abstract aspects and uncover the real sense of the text, which is a significant improvement over simpler text analysis methods."},
