{"concatenated_importance_weights_and_context_annotations": "The concatenated importance weights and context annotations refer to the combined result of the importance weights assigned to each word in a sentence and the context annotations that provide additional information about the words. These weights and annotations are crucial for understanding the significance and context of each word within the sentence."},
