{"the_issue_of_context_dependent_meaning_in_text_classification": "The issue of context-dependent meaning in text classification refers to the challenge of accurately interpreting the meaning of words and sentences in a document, which can vary depending on the context. This issue is significant in text classification as it affects the accuracy and effectiveness of the classification process."},
{"han__detects__important_words_within_a_sentence": "The predicate \"detects\" in this context refers to the HAN's capability to identify and recognize elements within text. Specifically, it highlights the model's function of discerning which words hold significance within a sentence, based on their context."},
