{"the_sec__publishes__statements_called_accounting_and_auditing_enforcement_releases_aaer": "The predicate \"publishes\" indicates the action taken by the SEC to make information available to the public. In this context, it refers to the SEC's act of issuing official statements to inform the public about enforcement actions related to financial reporting violations."},
