{"xgb__has_pr_auc__0_8338": "The predicate \"has_pr_auc\" indicates that the subject, in this case, the XGB model, has achieved a specific PR AUC (Precision-Recall Area Under the Curve) value. PR AUC is a performance metric used in binary classification to evaluate the trade-off between precision and recall."},
