{"ann__has_accuracy__0_6782": "The predicate \"has_accuracy\" indicates the performance metric of the ANN model, specifically its accuracy in correctly predicting outcomes or classifications in a given dataset."},
{"0_6782": "The object \"0.6782\" represents the accuracy score of the ANN model, indicating that it correctly predicted approximately 67.82% of the instances in the dataset it was evaluated on."},
{"ann__has_precision__0_6333": "The predicate \"has_precision\" indicates the level of accuracy or exactness of the ANN model's predictions. Precision is a metric used in classification problems to measure the proportion of true positive predictions among all positive predictions made by the model."},
