{"an_improvement": "\"An improvement\" refers to the enhanced performance or better results that the XGBoost classifier is achieving, particularly when combining FIN (Financial) and LING (Linguistic) data. This improvement is noted in terms of AUC (Area Under the Curve) and F2-score, indicating stronger predictive capabilities."},
