{"fin_data": "FIN data represents a specific dataset used in the evaluation of machine learning models. In this context, FIN data is one of the sources combined with LING data to assess the classifier's performance. The XGB model shows notable improvement and high performance, particularly on this FIN dataset, as indicated by its AUC and F2-score metrics."},
