{"xgb__superior_performance_in_terms_of__f2_score_with_76_87": "The phrase \"superior performance in terms of\" indicates that XGB is being assessed based on a specific metric, the F2-score, and is found to outperform other models in this regard. This suggests that XGB has a higher effectiveness in balancing precision and recall, which is crucial for the task at hand."},
