{"74_48": "The F2-score of 74.48% represents the performance of the SVM classifier on the combined FIN and LING data. This score indicates that SVM, while not the top performer, still demonstrates a relatively strong ability to classify the data effectively, highlighting the utility of advanced machine learning methods in practical applications."},
