{"the_attention_mechanisms_of_the_han__retain__the_logical_dependencies_of_the_content": "The term \"retain\" in this context means to keep or maintain. Here, it describes how the attention mechanisms of the HAN model preserve or maintain certain aspects of the text it analyzes."},
