{"svm__has__ability_to_deal_with_high_dimensional_sparse_feature_spaces": "The predicate \"has\" in this context signifies that SVM possesses a particular capability or characteristic. It indicates that SVM is equipped with a specific feature or attribute that makes it suitable for certain types of data processing tasks."},
