{"red_flag_words_identified_by_rf_and_han": "\"Red-flag words identified by RF and HAN\" refers to a set of words that have been flagged or marked as significant by two different methods or algorithms, Random Forest (RF) and Hierarchical Attention Network (HAN). These words are considered important or noteworthy within the context of the analysis presented in Fig. 4."},
