{"a_sentence_level_indication_of_text_fragments_that_trigger_the_classifier_to_treat_the_submitted_case_as_fraudulent": "A sentence-level indication of text fragments that trigger the classifier to treat the submitted case as fraudulent refers to the specific feature of the decision support solution that identifies and highlights individual sentences within a document that are indicative of fraudulent activity. This helps auditors to focus on critical sections of text that may signal potential fraud, thereby improving the efficiency and accuracy of their audits."},
