{"the_degree_of_impact_of_indicated_sentences": "The degree of impact of indicated sentences pertains to the level of influence or significance assigned to specific text fragments identified by the classifier as potential indicators of fraudulent behavior. These sentences are flagged by the system to alert auditors of possible red flags in the financial statements."},
