{"top_ten_words_with_the_strongest_effect_on_the_model_in_terms_of_fraud_indication": "The top ten words with the strongest effect on the model in terms of fraud indication are the specific words identified by the Lime package as having the most influence on the model's decision-making process in classifying fraud. These words are crucial in understanding which terms the model considers most indicative of fraudulent activity."},
