{"unique_sentence_level_analysis": "Unique sentence-level analysis refers to the specialized method employed by the HAN model to evaluate and assign weights to individual sentences within a report. This analysis is unique because it considers the hierarchical structure of language and the varying importance of words and sentences, providing a detailed and nuanced approach to detecting fraudulent content."},
