{"best_performances_in_previous_studies": "The \"best performances in previous studies\" refers to the superior results SVM has demonstrated in past research when compared to other models. These studies likely involved tasks such as fraud detection using the Bag of Words (BOW) approach, where SVM outperformed other algorithms in terms of accuracy and effectiveness."},
{"bow_approach__incorporated__in_previous_studies": "The term \"incorporated\" in this context refers to the inclusion or integration of the BOW approach within the methodologies of previous studies. It signifies that researchers have adopted this text representation technique as part of their analytical framework to enhance model performance in detecting fraudulent activities."},
