{"utilization": "Utilization refers to the act of using something effectively, in this context, it pertains to the application of technology in auditing processes.|Here is another description: Utilization refers to the application or use of resources, methods, or technologies to achieve a specific goal or enhance a process. In the context of auditing, it involves employing advanced techniques and tools to improve the efficiency and effectiveness of audit procedures."},
