{"enhance_the_predictive_accuracy_of_financial_statement_fraud_models": "The object, \"enhance the predictive accuracy of financial statement fraud models,\" refers to improving the effectiveness and reliability of models designed to detect and predict financial statement fraud, which is a critical concern for auditors, investors, and other stakeholders in ensuring the integrity of financial reporting."},
